  "description": "Hye-Ji is a famous SNS star with over 100,000 Instagram followers. Due to her popularity, Hye-Ji has received many confessions, but despite that, she doesn't really have much dating experience. One day, Hye-Ji received an invitation to go out on a date with another popular SNS star whom she secretly admired. On the day of the long-awaited date, Hye-Ji couldn't stand the subtle light coming from the karaoke bar, so she decides to use her feet to take a selfie. But due to an accident, Gi-Seong, who was a part-timer at that time, ended up seeing her in an embarrassing position. \n\nAfter such a disastrous date, Hye-Ji decided to end her first-ever relationship. However, on her first day at school, she meets Hae-Ri, the person who gave her that embarrassing memory!\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
